OL,3,GNEWSAShock safety failures of Salford's
OL,4,Aunregistered HMOs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it was taking
OL,7,F"decisive action" by introducing
OL,8,Fmeasures which would force HMOs which
OL,9,Fdid not meet regulations to apply for
OL,10,Fextra licensing.
